               Ellery                                                       Test Archer             
┌── Test Archer ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                                                                  │
│   Ellery! You came back for us.                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│   > I said I would. I keep my word.                                                              │
│     Someone has to carry your arrows.                                                            │
│     Get moving. We're not safe here.                                                             │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
